"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eDeionized Water\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eWater\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e85.30\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e-\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eC\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eGeogard 221\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eDehydroacetic Acid (and) Benzyl Alcohol\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1.00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eLonza\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eD\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eSunPuro Sparkle White\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eMica (and) Titanium Dioxide\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2.50\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eSun Chemical\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eCitric Acid (10% Solution in Water)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eCitric Acid, Water\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eq.s.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e-\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e제조공정\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase A를 예비 혼합합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e실버슨(Silverson) 교반 하에 Phase A를 Phase B에 투입하고 고전단(High shear)으로 수 분간 균질화합니다. 균일해지면 프로펠러 교반기로 교체합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e프로펠러 교반 하에 Phase C를 AB 혼합액에 첨가합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e프로펠러 교반 하에 Phase D를 투입합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase E를 사용하여 최종 pH를 6.2~6.5로 조절합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e규격 및 특성\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003e외관:\u003c/strong\u003e 반짝이는 은빛 유동체 (Glittery silver fluid)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003epH:\u003c/strong\u003e 6.2 - 6.5\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003e점도:\u003c/strong\u003e 48,000 cP (Brookfield DV-II, Spindle #6, 2.5 rpm)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n \u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;\"\u003e[처방 가이드라인 및 면책 고지 (Disclaimer)]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1. 연구·개발(R\u0026amp;D) 참고용 한정: 본 처방 데이터는 화장품 제형 개발을 위한 참고용 가이드이며, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e완제품의 효능, 안전성, 안정성 및 유통 기한을 보증하지 않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2. 사전 테스트 및 검증 책임: 실제 양산 적용 전, 개발사 및 제조사의 책임 하에 충분한 예비 실험, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e상용화 테스트, 제형 안정성 및 방부력 테스트를 거쳐야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e3. 규제 및 법규 준수: 원료별 배합 한도, 수출 대상국(국내 식약처, FDA, EU CPNP, NMPA 등)의 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e화장품 관련 법규 및 최신 규제 사항은 개발사가 직접 사전 검토·확인해야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e4. 지식재산권 및 법적 책임 한계: 본 처방에 포함된 일부 원료 조합 및 정보는 외부 원료사의 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e가이드에 기반하고 있으며, 이와 관련된 특허권, 지식재산권 저촉 여부 및 본 처방 활용으로 인해 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e발생하는 제품의 물리적·화학적·법적 문제에 대한 모든 책임은 전적으로 이를 활용하여 제품을 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e개발·생산하는 개발 주체(고객사)에게 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 시작 --\u003e\n\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 끝 --\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"kboard-document-action\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"right\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"kboard-button-action kboard-button-print\" onclick=\"kboard_document_print(\u0027https://wordpress-1663666-6630820.cloudwaysapps.com/?action=kboard_document_print\u0026uid=463\u0027)\" title=\"인쇄\"\u003e인쇄\u003c/button\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t",
