"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eRefractive index adjuster\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1.50\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eF\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eF7231483\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eFragrance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eIFF\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eFragrance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1.00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e제조공정 (COLD PROCESS / 비가열 공정)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase A를 준비합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e중-강속 교반 하에 Phase A에 Lecigel™을 살포하고 뭉침이 완전히 사라질 때까지 교반합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase C를 투입합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase D의 원료들을 별도로 사전 혼합합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase ABC 혼합물에 Phase D를 천천히 조금씩 분할 투입합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e교반 속도를 낮춥니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e저속 교반 하에 Phase E와 Phase F를 하나씩 순차적으로 투입하고 균일해질 때까지 혼합합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e최종 점도는 제조 1일 후 안정적으로 형성됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e규격 및 물성\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• 외관(Aspect): 반투명한 황색 겔 (Translucent yellowish gel)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• 점도: \u0026gt; 100,000 mPa·s (Brookfield LV, spindle 4, 6 rpm, 1분)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• 안정성: 50°C 1개월, 실온(RT), 4~8°C, 45°C 조건에서 3개월 안정, 원심분리(3,000 rpm, 20분) 및 진동 테이블(400 rpm, 4시간) 안정 통과\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n \u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;\"\u003e[처방 가이드라인 및 면책 고지 (Disclaimer)]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1. 연구·개발(R\u0026amp;D) 참고용 한정: 본 처방 데이터는 화장품 제형 개발을 위한 참고용 가이드이며, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e완제품의 효능, 안전성, 안정성 및 유통 기한을 보증하지 않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2. 사전 테스트 및 검증 책임: 실제 양산 적용 전, 개발사 및 제조사의 책임 하에 충분한 예비 실험, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e상용화 테스트, 제형 안정성 및 방부력 테스트를 거쳐야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e3. 규제 및 법규 준수: 원료별 배합 한도, 수출 대상국(국내 식약처, FDA, EU CPNP, NMPA 등)의 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e화장품 관련 법규 및 최신 규제 사항은 개발사가 직접 사전 검토·확인해야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e4. 지식재산권 및 법적 책임 한계: 본 처방에 포함된 일부 원료 조합 및 정보는 외부 원료사의 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e가이드에 기반하고 있으며, 이와 관련된 특허권, 지식재산권 저촉 여부 및 본 처방 활용으로 인해 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e발생하는 제품의 물리적·화학적·법적 문제에 대한 모든 책임은 전적으로 이를 활용하여 제품을 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e개발·생산하는 개발 주체(고객사)에게 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 시작 --\u003e\n\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 끝 --\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"kboard-document-action\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"right\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"kboard-button-action kboard-button-print\" onclick=\"kboard_document_print(\u0027https://wordpress-1663666-6630820.cloudwaysapps.com/?action=kboard_document_print\u0026uid=394\u0027)\" title=\"인쇄\"\u003e인쇄\u003c/button\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t",
