"\u003eXanthan Gum\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eXanthan Gum\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eThickener\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e0.1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eGlycerin\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eGlycerin\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eHumectant\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e3.0\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eSharomix AM 25\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhenoxyethanol (and) Chlorphenesin (and) Caprylyl Glycol (and) Didecyldimonium Chloride\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePreservative\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e0.7\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e제조공정\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e제조 용기에 Hallbrite BHB와 Amphisol K를 계량하고 교반 하에 85°C로 가열함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e나머지 Phase A 원료들을 추가하고 70°C로 맞추어 균일해질 때까지 혼합함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e별도 용기에 Phase B의 정제수를 계량하여 75°C로 가열함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e가열된 정제수에 Valida S+를 넣고 8,000 rpm에서 5분간 고속 균질화(homogenise)함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e잔탄검(Xanthan gum)을 글리세린에 미리 분산시켜 둠.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eValida S+ 균질화가 끝난 수성상에 잔탄검 분산물 및 나머지 Phase B 원료들을 투입함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase B 수상을 70°C로 맞춤.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase B에 Phase A를 투입함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e유화물이 형성될 때까지 3,000~4,000 rpm에서 5분간 균질화함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e프로펠러 교반을 진행하며 제형을 냉각하고, 배치가 50°C 미만으로 내려가면 잔여 성분(보존제 등)을 순차적으로 투입하여 균일해질 때까지 혼합함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e규격\u003c/strong\u003e: 자외선 차단 지수 SPF 20 (미네랄 필터 단독 처방)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n \u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;\"\u003e[처방 가이드라인 및 면책 고지 (Disclaimer)]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1. 연구·개발(R\u0026amp;D) 참고용 한정: 본 처방 데이터는 화장품 제형 개발을 위한 참고용 가이드이며, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e완제품의 효능, 안전성, 안정성 및 유통 기한을 보증하지 않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2. 사전 테스트 및 검증 책임: 실제 양산 적용 전, 개발사 및 제조사의 책임 하에 충분한 예비 실험, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e상용화 테스트, 제형 안정성 및 방부력 테스트를 거쳐야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e3. 규제 및 법규 준수: 원료별 배합 한도, 수출 대상국(국내 식약처, FDA, EU CPNP, NMPA 등)의 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e화장품 관련 법규 및 최신 규제 사항은 개발사가 직접 사전 검토·확인해야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e4. 지식재산권 및 법적 책임 한계: 본 처방에 포함된 일부 원료 조합 및 정보는 외부 원료사의 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e가이드에 기반하고 있으며, 이와 관련된 특허권, 지식재산권 저촉 여부 및 본 처방 활용으로 인해 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e발생하는 제품의 물리적·화학적·법적 문제에 대한 모든 책임은 전적으로 이를 활용하여 제품을 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e개발·생산하는 개발 주체(고객사)에게 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 시작 --\u003e\n\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 끝 --\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"kboard-document-action\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"right\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"kboard-button-action kboard-button-print\" onclick=\"kboard_document_print(\u0027https://wordpress-1663666-6630820.cloudwaysapps.com/?action=kboard_document_print\u0026uid=312\u0027)\" title=\"인쇄\"\u003e인쇄\u003c/button\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t",
